     "modularrouters:modular_router",
     "modularrouters:blank_module"
    ]
   },
   {
    "note": "The router UI has three parts and guides teach them in order: buffer, modules, upgrades.",
    "ids": [
     "modularrouters:modular_router",
     "modularrouters:blank_module",
     "modularrouters:blank_upgrade"
    ]
   },
   {
    "note": "First useful modules are the simple environment pair - breaker and placer - before any logistics work.",
    "ids": [
     "modularrouters:breaker_module",
